sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant R as Resolving DNS server (ISP)
    participant T as .com TLD server
    participant Z as Route 53 hosted zone
    B->>R: where is www.zekelabs.com?
    R->>T: query
    T-->>R: NS records: ask Route 53 name servers
    R->>Z: query www.zekelabs.com
    Z-->>R: A record 123.10.10.80, TTL 300 s
    R-->>B: 123.10.10.80 (cached for the TTL)
    B->>B: connect to 123.10.10.80
